I've been thinking and experimenting quite a bit recently with nethack,
especially about artifacts, alignment, and character class balance.  I'm
sure the dev team has also considered these areas, among many others,
in designing 3.1.  I was wondering if there were any documents, mailing
lists, ftp sites, etc where I could see/hear some other people's ideas,
and perhaps contribute my own.  I'm not looking for spoilers about 3.1
necessarily (although I eagerly await it), but I'd like to know if some
of the problems I've noticed will be addressed.

For example, it is unfortunate that holy water can be made only at a
Lawful altar, even if you are Chaotic.  This means a Chaotic
character, upon finding a Lawful altar, needs to decide whether he/she
wants to (a) save it to make holy water, or (b) convert it to play the
sacrifice game.  A Lawful character has the best of both worlds
(assuming that being able to bless is more important than being able
to curse, of course).

